    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A science fiction and horror adventure-action game with first-person and third-person gameplay perspectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an operative, you are assigned to a remote research facility known as <strong>Area 8</strong>, a place so secret that even its name is hidden from the public. What awaits you within this facility are experiments that push the boundaries of science and nature, mind-bending creatures, and fragments of an intricate mystery. But beware\u2014once you step inside, there\u2019s no guarantee of coming back...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you dare to unveil the mystery, add <strong>Area 8</strong> to your wishlist now!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A science fiction and horror adventure-action game with first-person and third-person gameplay perspectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an operative, you are assigned to a remote research facility known as <strong>Area 8</strong>, a place so secret that even its name is hidden from the public. What awaits you within this facility are experiments that push the boundaries of science and nature, mind-bending creatures, and fragments of an intricate mystery. But beware\u2014once you step inside, there\u2019s no guarantee of coming back...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you dare to unveil the mystery, add <strong>Area 8</strong> to your wishlist now!</p>",
